# QUESTION: Does a live reload adding a managed client entry make the hub
# list it immediately (never connected) and admit it when it connects?
# WHY NOT A UNIT TEST: exercises the full hub reload transaction through
# `ze data import` beside a running hub, live listener bind, and a real managed
# client daemon connecting over TLS.
# VALIDATES: fleet-1 AC-8, AC-26.
option=timeout:value=240s
cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture managed/fleet-devices-reload-add $PORT $PORT2 $PORT3:timeout=240s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=OK: reload added managed client and listed it connected
